{"id":"vod_sn_36912","vodId":"36912","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"百花缭乱武士新娘","name_cn":"百花缭乱武士新娘","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a2429c73d2af82966bfc005bfd055809.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在德川幕府第二十五代将军德川庆康统治下的日本，德川家设立了武应学园，并组织了学生会，用以对抗还试图顽固抵抗的丰臣一派。柳生宗朗（平川大辅 配音）是武应学园的高材生，一天，当他正在道场里练习时，一位名叫柳生十兵卫（悠木碧 配音）的美少女从天而降，柳生就这样莫名其妙的多了一个“妹妹”，和十兵卫开始了同居生活。　　外表年幼实则足智多谋的真田幸村（钉宫理惠 配音）、英姿飒爽大大咧咧的后藤又兵卫（小林优 配音）、优雅的千金大小姐德川千姬（寿美菜子 配音）、风纪委员服部半蔵（后藤沙绪里 配音），这些姑娘们接二连三的出现在了柳生的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qLHmxPFd9N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/53EWxL6tyx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1h15utJ0QA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5mNX8hipT91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VzbHSNiCdQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tw30aFkpMJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UEtePKSHKp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JAzdHrCEmX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qwgaEqs8QJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NNXtjxML3m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tu9A3FMmUN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kPS84zXCBn1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:17.249Z"}